+// The highlight knee, resolved in ONE place. Two passes threshold on it now - the splat, which
+// deposits the excess, and (in lens mode) the downscale, which subtracts exactly that excess
+// from the layers the gather is built on. If the two ever disagreed the hybrid would stop
+// summing to the frame, so neither is allowed its own copy of the derivation.
+// Soft knee spanning +/-50% of the threshold: wide on purpose, a hard cut makes highlights pop
+// as the aperture or the focus sweeps past them.
+static void ResolveHighlightKnee(float fUserThreshold, float& fThreshold, float& fKnee)
+{
+	fThreshold = max(fUserThreshold, 0.0f);
+	fKnee = max(fThreshold * 0.5f, 0.01f);
